                        "sense_id": "73d78d2a-7d3d-3bce-a9de-093737f23f9d",
                        "entry_id": "23d7231c-0281-3801-a3b2-06a990e6b010",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Frightening or unnerving in the manner of something eerie or supernatural; spooky."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cdb810d0-2097-4f1c-9257-9160f68902a6",
                                "sense_id": "73d78d2a-7d3d-3bce-a9de-093737f23f9d",
                                "text": "I hope we find some nicer spot than this. This looks so lonely and spookish."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb6bfa50-ec2b-403b-b0ee-0ad6e09533bb",
                                "sense_id": "73d78d2a-7d3d-3bce-a9de-093737f23f9d",
                                "text": "Religion is everywhere a gauge of respectability. . . . The right to participate, however humbly, in His august and transcendental operations offers a powerful satisfaction to the will to power; the same privilege, on a smaller scale, is what takes hordes of human blanks into the Freemasons and other such spookish amalgamations of nonentities."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6d56aa9b-0583-3307-a157-0d72f94fe221",
                        "entry_id": "23d7231c-0281-3801-a3b2-06a990e6b010",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Easily startled, frightened, or unnerved."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal",
                            "often"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "32c0051f-010d-460d-b3d3-5f9d7674a46c",
                                "sense_id": "6d56aa9b-0583-3307-a157-0d72f94fe221",
                                "text": "In those moments thus spent in composing myself for sleep, I sometimes wondered in the last human occupant of the room were not a dead one. I was senselessly spookish about such things."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "508589d9-e995-4e64-9773-e1de5bdfbf5e",
                                "sense_id": "6d56aa9b-0583-3307-a157-0d72f94fe221",
                                "text": "As a lesson horse she needs to gain confidence in her rider, or can become spookish over the jumps, dodging out of them."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
